				<Coords points="222,1913 237,1913 238,1903 248,1903 249,1913 266,1913 266,1902 332,1902 333,1914 387,1913 388,1902 408,1902 431,1914 464,1914 465,1904 477,1904 477,1915 499,1915 521,1902 542,1902 553,1903 554,1914 571,1914 572,1904 669,1903 670,1914 759,1914 759,1905 810,1905 832,1915 924,1914 924,1903 945,1903 946,1915 1068,1915 1091,1902 1099,1902 1099,1914 1124,1914 1124,1902 1158,1902 1203,1902 1203,1914 1224,1914 1226,1927 1233,1927 1233,1938 1226,1938 1224,1932 1158,1938 1091,1938 1031,1933 1010,1943 989,1943 989,1933 907,1933 907,1943 886,1943 885,1933 431,1933 222,1931" />
